        "original_id": "357d1dc3-eb58-561a-9642-973e4a0c39e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Basij, CNN, BBC, Fox News, Fox Entertainment Group, 21st Century Fox\n- Places: New York City, 1211 Avenue of the Americas\n- Topics: Death of Neda Agha-Soltan, disputed responsibility for Neda Agha-Soltan's killing\n- Products: Fox News Channel\n\nFacts:\n- CNN, BBC, and Fox News reported that Basij, a paramilitary organization, shot Neda Agha-Soltan, although the identity of her killer is disputed.\n- Fox News, officially the Fox News Channel and commonly abbreviated FNC, is an American basic cable and satellite television news channel.\n- Fox News is owned by the Fox Entertainment Group, which is a subsidiary of 21st Century Fox.\n- Fox News broadcasts primarily from studios at 1211 Avenue of the Americas in New York City, New York.",
